{"unit_id":"Hanice404__dsh-width#card-zh","repo":"Hanice404/dsh-width","commit":"7e55beea52d91b8cd51f961dad46cd17077ca214","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-width 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 的显示设置插件，在设置中增加独立的“显示”页面。它通过宿主端注册持久化设置，并在浏览器端提供两个滑块，分别调整消息内容列和底部输入框的宽度，修改后立即应用。滑块范围为 30% 至 100%，默认 100%，支持恢复默认值；插件还会让新会话菜单行与输入框对齐，并同步任务列表宽度。适合希望按屏幕空间调整 DSH Web 阅读和输入区域的用户。需要 DSH Web，不需要额外 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:29-56","lib/client.js:127-136","lib/client.js:320-363"]}
{"unit_id":"Hanice404__dsh-width#card-en","repo":"Hanice404/dsh-width","commit":"7e55beea52d91b8cd51f961dad46cd17077ca214","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-width adds a Display page to DSH Web with sliders for message and composer widths. Settings persist and apply immediately; values range from 30% to 100%, default to 100%, and can be reset. It aligns the new-session menu and task panel with the composer. Requires DSH Web; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:29-56","lib/client.js:127-136","lib/client.js:320-363"]}
